    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University (AKU) will host a two-day seminar on 'English and Empowerment in the Developing World' on June 9 and 10, 2007. Dr Atta-ur-Rahman, Advisor to the Prime Minister on Science and Technology and Chairman Higher Education Commission, will be the chief guest on the occasion.",
